:: Loft Smoke Whitney Tease
<<effects>>
You lean further out, propping your chin on your hand, and let a slow smile spread.
<<if $speech_attitude is "confident" or $speech_attitude is "flamboyant" or $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"That old winch? I dunno, Whitney. It's rated for baskets of sweets, not whatever you've been eating.
	Reckon it'll snap the second it takes your fat head." You sneer.
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "capricious" or $speech_attitude is "special" or $speech_attitude is "cruel">>
