:: Loft Smoke Whitney Together
<<effects>><<wearProp "cigarette">>
<<if !$daily.loftWhitneyPack>><<set $cigarettes += 4>><<set $daily.loftWhitneyPack to true>><</if>>
You shake one of Whitney's cigarettes loose. <<He>> shuffles in close beside you against the sill,
close enough that <<his>> shoulder presses warm to yours, and cups a lighter to the tip for you.
The flame catches. You both lean out the window and smoke.
<br><br>
Neither of you says anything at all after that.
<br><br>
It's strange. The Whitney everyone else gets is all noise and teeth and threat, but here, with smoke leaking slow from
<<his>> lips and <<his>> eyes half-closed against the light, <<he>> goes quiet. Almost serene.
The hard line of <<his>> shoulders eases. You catch yourself watching <<him>> instead of the forest,
and you can't quite look away.
<br><br>
Then, without warning, <<his>> mouth curls. "Oi. Look at this, slut."
<br><br>
<<He>> draws deep, purses <<his>> lips, and taps <<his>> cheek with two fingers,
knocking out a neat little chain of smoke rings that drift out the window and hold their shape an
impossibly long time before they unravel. <<He>> smirks at you, smug as anything, daring you to match it.
<br><br>
<<link [[Try to do it too|Loft Smoke Whitney Shapes]]>><</link>>
